        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sound insulation cogen unit 160kWe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sound insulation cogen unit 160kWe
Inventory refers to infrastructure of an existing natural gas cogeneration plant (lambda=1 motor, 160kWe, operation start 1987) at Jakobsberg, Basel, Switzerland. (Life time for operation assumed 100'000 h.);
UUID: 809d431b-b5d0-3cb2-8c5f-1ce9b0d7c006
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the water needed for production.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Component of a specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland. Technology at end of 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_809d431b-b5d0-3cb2-8c5f-1ce9b0d7c006.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
